5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright, let's get this started! I'm going to find that werewolf no matter what. Everyone, be honest about your roles if you have to, but I'll be watching you all very closely!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,"Now, now, Takumi. Let's not rush into things with such intensity. A calm approach is far more effective when trying to discern the truth. I shall observe and see how things unfold.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm excited to play with everyone! Let's all try our best and work together to find the werewolf. I'm sure we can do it if we stay positive! Good luck, everyone!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree with George. Rushing into accusations without any information will only lead to mistakes. Let's keep a cool head and observe each other's behavior for now.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm ready too! This is like a real mystery adventure! I'll use my super-detective eyes to find the bad wolf! Let's have lots of fun, everyone!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@George @Misaki You both sound way too calm. It's almost suspicious! I don't need to rush to know that someone here is lying. I'm going to figure out who it is, just watch me!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"@Takumi Your enthusiasm is admirable, but equating composure with guilt is a leap in logic. I am simply relying on my experience to keep a steady hand. Let us see what the first night reveals.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, don't be so mean to them! Being calm is just a different way of helping. Let's all just be friends and try our best! I believe in everyone here!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi Suspicion without evidence is just noise. If you want to find the werewolf, you should focus on logic rather than how we speak. I'll be watching your reactions as well.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Rin,,@Takumi You're being too noisy! It's not a mystery if you just shout at everyone. I'm going to watch everyone's faces really closely to see who's acting weird! Hehe!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin @Yumi I'm not being noisy, I'm being proactive! If we just sit around ""observing,"" the werewolf is just going to laugh at us. I'm not backing down until we catch them!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"@Takumi Proactivity is a virtue, but not when it clouds judgment. We have no information yet. Let us allow the Seer to do their work tonight; that will provide the foundation we actually need.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"@George is right! Let's trust the Seer and wait for the first clue. @Takumi, your passion is great, but let's try to be a team! I'm sure we'll find the wolf together!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi Your passion is noted, but George is correct. We have no data yet. Let's wait for the Seer's results tomorrow before we start making any definitive claims. It's the only logical way to proceed.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi You're like a grumpy big brother! But George and Misaki are right, we need a clue first. I can't use my detective eyes if there's no mystery to solve yet! I'm waiting for tomorrow!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Fine, I'll wait for tomorrow! But don't think I'm letting my guard down. I'm going to find the truth and protect everyone, even if you all think I'm just being noisy! See you tomorrow!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,George,,"Very well. Let us all get some rest and hope for a productive morning. I shall be reflecting on our conversation tonight. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"Goodnight, everyone! Sleep well and have sweet dreams! I'm looking forward to seeing you all tomorrow morning. Let's keep this positive energy going! Bye-bye!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Misaki,,Goodnight. Let's hope for a clear lead tomorrow. I'll be resting as well.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Rin,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to dream about catching the wolf with a giant net! See you all tomorrow for the big reveal! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
