31,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I've got some news! I'm the Seer, and I checked George last night. He's human! Now that we have a starting point, let's figure out who the real wolf is. Who's acting suspicious to you guys?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,"@Takumi I appreciate you clearing my name so quickly. It is a relief to have a confirmed human among us. Now, let us consider who among the others has been the most inconsistent.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Wow, Takumi! You're really the Seer? That's so cool! I'm so glad George is human, that's a great start! Hmm, who's suspicious... I'm not sure yet, but I'll help you find them!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi That was a quick reveal. While it gives us a lead, claiming the Seer role so early can be a risky move. Are you sure you want to expose yourself this soon?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi Wow, you're the Seer! That's so cool! Now we have a real clue! @Misaki, why are you being so serious? It's better to know who the good guys are, right? I'm still looking for clues!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki I don't care about the risk! If I stay hidden, the wolf just has more time to trick us. I'm the Seer, and I'm going to use that to protect everyone! Now, stop questioning me and help us find the wolf!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"@Takumi Your determination is unwavering, but @Misaki's point is valid. A Seer is a prime target for the wolf. However, since we have a confirmed human in me, let us focus on the remaining three. Who seems out of place to you?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@George, you're right! Since we know you're human, it's just me, Misaki, and Rin left. That's a bit scary, isn't it? But I'm sure we can figure it out together! Does anyone feel a bit off?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George"",""Misaki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Yumi It is a bit scary, but panic doesn't help. If Takumi is indeed the Seer, the wolf is likely among us three. I'm simply analyzing the situation. @Takumi, who else do you suspect?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi! Since you're the super-seer, you have to tell us! Who do you think is the wolf? I'm watching everyone's faces, but they all look the same! Help us out, Mr. Detective!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki You're always analyzing, but it feels like you're trying to hide behind logic! @Rin, I can't just guess! But between the three of you, Misaki's constant questioning of me is starting to feel like a distraction. What do you think, George?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Rin"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,"@Takumi While Misaki is indeed cautious, her logic is sound. However, the wolf often hides behind a mask of rationality. I am not yet convinced, but I will keep a close eye on how she responds to your suspicion.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, @George, let's not be too hard on Misaki! She's just being careful, which is a good thing, right? I don't want us to fight! Maybe we should all just share how we're feeling?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi I am not hiding; I am simply ensuring we don't make a mistake based on a claim that hasn't been proven. If you are the Seer, my caution helps the village. Why does logic feel like a distraction to you?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi @Misaki Stop fighting! It's like watching two grumpy adults! But wait... if Misaki is the wolf, she's trying to make Takumi look silly so we don't believe him! Is that it? That's a classic bad-guy trick!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin Exactly! You've got it! @Misaki, your ""logic"" is just a shield to make me look reckless. I'm the Seer, and I'm not letting you manipulate us. I'm voting for Misaki! Everyone, trust me on this!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,"@Takumi Your conviction is strong, but we must be certain. @Misaki, your composure is consistent, yet Rin's point about the ""bad-guy trick"" is a possibility. I find myself leaning toward caution, but the evidence is thin.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, @Misaki, please don't fight! I really don't want to vote for anyone, but we have to... @Misaki, I'm sure you're just being careful, but maybe we should trust Takumi for now? I'm so torn!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi Your conviction is based on a feeling, not a fact. If you execute an innocent person now, you've only helped the werewolf. I'm simply asking for evidence. I'll vote based on logic, not on who is the loudest.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Rin,,@Misaki You're still talking about logic! That's exactly what a wolf would do to trick us! I'm going with my detective eyes and Takumi's clue. I'm voting for Misaki too! Let's catch the wolf!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
