64,2,1,talk,George,,"It seems our suspicions were not entirely misplaced, as Takumi was attacked. This suggests the werewolf felt threatened by his claim. However, we must now consider if Misaki was truly the wolf or merely a victim of our haste.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no! Takumi was attacked! That's so terrible! I can't believe it... He was trying so hard to protect us. Does this mean Misaki really was the wolf, or is the wolf still among us? I'm so scared now!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Yumi Don't be scared! Takumi was a hero! Since the wolf attacked him, it means he was definitely a threat to them. That means we were right to vote for Misaki, right? Or is there still a sneaky wolf hiding?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,George,,"@Rin We must not be complacent. If Misaki was the werewolf, the game would have ended. Since we are still here, the werewolf remains. This means Misaki was likely innocent, and we have lost a valuable ally.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@George, wait... you mean Misaki wasn't the wolf? That's awful! We made a mistake! I feel so bad for her... Now we're even more in danger! Who could it be? I'm so confused and scared!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@George What?! You mean the wolf is still here? That's not fair! My detective eyes were tricked! If Misaki wasn't the wolf, then who is it? @Yumi, stop crying! We have to find the real bad guy now!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Misaki"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,George,,"@Yumi, @Rin, please compose yourselves. Panic is the werewolf's greatest ally. We are left with the three of us. Since I am confirmed human, the wolf must be either Yumi or Rin. Let us think clearly.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@George, me?! But I would never hurt anyone! I'm just so sad about Misaki and Takumi... I can't believe we're in this situation! @Rin, you're the detective, you have to help us figure this out!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George"",""Misaki"",""Takumi"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@George That's not fair! I'm a detective, not a wolf! @Yumi is the one who's been acting all scared and confused. Maybe that's just a trick to make us feel sorry for her! I'm watching you, Yumi!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,George,,"@Rin @Yumi Let us avoid baseless accusations. Both of you have been consistent in your personas. However, the wolf often mimics innocence. I shall weigh your reactions carefully before we cast our final votes.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"@George, please believe me! I'm just a normal girl who wants everyone to be happy! @Rin, how can you say that? I'm genuinely sad! I'll do anything to help us find the real wolf! Please, let's trust each other!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""George"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Yumi You're acting too much like a movie character! ""Normal girl"" and ""everyone happy"" is exactly what a sneaky wolf would say to hide! @George, I'm a kid, I don't know how to lie like that! It's Yumi!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
